or  easy victims or use your hyper to scoot  around the flank and surprise your  rotten foes hyper is also important for  taking the fight to the zombies in  gardens and graveyards if you can find  that teleporter and keep them from  building it you'll force them to waste  precious time shambling from their spawn  point use Hyper with frequent jumps to  make it hard for your enemies to track  you and then lay waste to any engineers  that come within range as for rooting  down as a Gatling peashooter you'll want  to reserve that for long ish distances  and for shutting down routes commonly  walked by the dead  healing peashooters is a noble goal for  sunflowers and the heal beam has a  really quick cool down so you can pretty  much use it whenever you need it and  don't forget that sunflowers can use  their primary weapon while heal beaming  to support the team's organic offensive  just don't get too cocky and put  yourself out on the frontlines because  you are a fairly delicate little  sunflower hanging back a bit we'll also  position you well for reviving allies  which you can do extra quickly and which  is super important for your defensive  efforts and super mega important in team  vanquish where each revive is a point  stolen from the zambese if the shambling  horrors are still at a distance though  go ahead and pot yourself and beam happy  sunshine rays of death right into their  undead eyeballs throw down a heal flower  to increase your longevity and it's cute  and like you know pretty helpful also  last but not least the weirdest weed in  the bunch the chopper with no projectile  weapon and a penchant for jean paree  it's a whole different game when you  play the purple plant you can take out  any zombie player with a single chomp  provided you sneak up behind them and  see that red target appear on them this  gets easier if you burrow as zombies  might not see you or might not be able  to maneuver away fast enough and if you  burrow and remain absolutely still  you'll be completely undetectable until  the moment of cheong this toothy  salivating swallow is one of the most  satisfying moves in the game but it  leaves you vulnerable because it takes  time to choke down all that festering  flesh if you can slow nearby enemies  with coop before you chomp you stand a  better chance of survival and laying  down spiked weed traps as you flee is a  good way to hinder your pursuers as long  as you save a spiked weed for desperate  escapes you should feel free to throw  them down as often as you can properly  timed abilities can be a big difference  maker but unused abilities are like so  many unsewn seeds never to bear fruit  Destin's to be eaten by birds somehow  most plants are better at range so keep  your distance and coordinate your firing  lines stick with your teammates revive  your teammates and celebrate victory by  dancing with your teammates plant power  you
 

